    category: "Linux",
    title: "Linux 7.3 早期測試報告：在高性能工作站上評測不同核心版本性能差異",
    summary: "本文針對 Linux 7.0、7.1、7.2 和 7.3 Git 版本的核心，在一台搭載 Intel Xeon 678X Granite Rapids WS處理器的 HP Z4 G6i 工作站上進行了早期基準測試。測試使用了 Ubuntu 26.10 日常軟體堆疊，並涵蓋了多種不同工作負載的評測。報告指出 Linux 7.3 的性能表現存在一些提升和回歸（regressions）。所有核心版本均使用相同的編譯器從原始碼進行構建，以確保比較的一致性。測試結果旨在幫助使用者了解新版核心與穩定舊版核心之間的效能差異。\n\n由於原文未提供具體的性能數據或CVSS分數，本摘要僅描述了測試的範圍和目的。",
    tags: ["Linux 7.3", "Linux 核心", "Ubuntu 26.10", "Intel Xeon 678X", "性能評測", "Nouveau driver"],
    title_en: "Linux 7.3 Early Testing Report: Evaluating Performance Differences Across Core Versions on High-Performance Workstations",
    summary_en: "This article details early benchmark testing of Linux 7.0, 7.1, 7.2, and 7.3 Git versions of the kernel. The tests were conducted on an HP Z4 G6i workstation equipped with an Intel Xeon 678X Granite Rapids WS processor. Using the Ubuntu 26.10 desktop software stack, the evaluation covered various different workloads. The report notes that Linux 7.3 exhibits both performance improvements and regressions. All kernel versions were built from source using the same compiler to ensure comparative consistency. The test results aim to help users understand the performance differences between the new kernel version and stable older kernels.\n\nSince the original text did not provide specific performance data or CVSS scores, this summary only describes the scope and purpose of the testing.",
