    category: "Android",
    title: "Pixel 11與Pixel 10深度比較：外觀微調、軟體升級及相機系統的差異分析",
    summary: "本文對比了Google Pixel 10和新發布的Pixel 11，指出兩者在硬體設計上極為相似，幾乎沒有明顯區別。主要改動包括相機模組邊框的微調、內嵌式LED閃光燈的散光改善，以及整體重量減輕（從204g降至197g）。軟體方面，Pixel 11運行Android 17體驗，雖然功能差異不大，但提升了儲存速度和引入了Gboard優化的語音輸入工具Rambler。相機系統是主要升級點：主鏡頭採用新的感光元件，可提高過曝光線收集能力超過50%，改善背景虛化效果；同時新增了「Camera Looks」功能，允許使用者即時設定預設色調，並提升至30倍的變焦能力。整體而言，兩機在電池續航和處理器性能（Tensor G5 vs. G6）上均未有巨大飛躍，但Pixel 11透過感光元件與軟體功能實現了實用性的升級。",
    tags: ["Google Pixel 11", "Pixel 10", "Android 17", "Tensor G6", "Camera Looks", "AOSP"],
    title_en: "Pixel 11 vs. Pixel 10 Deep Dive Comparison: Analyzing Design Tweaks, Software Upgrades, and Camera System Differences",
    summary_en: "This article compares the Google Pixel 10 with the newly released Pixel 11, noting that the two devices are extremely similar in hardware design, showing almost no noticeable differences. Key changes include minor adjustments to the camera module bezel, improved diffusion for the embedded LED flash, and overall weight reduction (from 204g down to 197g). On the software front, the Pixel 11 runs Android 17 experience. While functional differences are minimal, it improves storage speed and introduces Rambler, an optimized voice input tool integrated with Gboard. The camera system is the main area of upgrade: the main lens uses a new sensor that can increase overexposure line collection capability by more than 50%, improving background bokeh; furthermore, it adds 'Camera Looks,' allowing users to set preset color tones in real-time, and boosts zoom capability up to 30x. Overall, neither device shows massive leaps in battery life or processor performance (Tensor G5 vs. G6), but the Pixel 11 achieves practical upgrades through its sensor technology and software features.",
    tags_en: ["Google Pixel 11", "Pixel 10", "Android 17", "Tensor G6", "Camera Looks", "AOSP"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Google", url: "https://9to5google.com/2026/08/24/pixel-10-vs-pixel-11", lang: "EN" }
    ]
