    category: "Android",
    title: "Pixel 11 Pro 新增「裝置協助」工具：Gemini App 提供個人化設備輔助功能",
    summary: "Google 在 Pixel 11 Pro 機型上，透過 Gemini 應用程式推出名為「Device help」（裝置協助）的新工具。此功能位於 Gemini app 的選單內，並標註了「Labs」字樣。該「Device Help Agent」旨在提供個人化且對話式的設備輔助服務，使用者可藉由它來管理系統設定、排除各種問題，以及了解更多手機功能。\n\n具體功能包括：調整顯示設定（如深色模式、亮度）、聲音與震動模式；診斷和解決 Wi-Fi、藍牙、行動數據或電池耗盡等問題；管理電池使用量和儲存空間；審核應用程式權限（如位置、相機）；以及提供 Pixel 特性、手勢和隱私控制的步驟指引。\n\n報導指出，此新功能似乎只是利用了現有的「Device Assistance」（裝置協助）連動應用程式，該服務先前曾名為「Utilities」。目前觀察到此功能僅在升級至 Google app beta 17.52 的 Pixel 11 Pro 機型上可用，尚未在基礎款 Pixel 11 或舊機型上推出。",
    tags: ["Pixel 11 Pro", "Gemini App", "Device help", "Google", "Android OS"],
    title_en: "Pixel 11 Pro Adds 'Device Help' Tool via Gemini App for Personalized Device Assistance",
    summary_en: "Google has introduced a new tool called \"Device help\" on the Pixel 11 Pro, accessible through the Gemini app. This feature is located within the Gemini app menu and is marked with \"Labs.\" The \"Device Help Agent\" aims to provide personalized, conversational device assistance, allowing users to manage system settings, troubleshoot various issues, and learn more about phone functionalities.\n\nSpecific functions include adjusting display settings (such as dark mode and brightness), managing sound and vibration modes; diagnosing and resolving issues related to Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, mobile data, or battery drain; managing battery usage and storage space; reviewing application permissions (such as location and camera); and providing step-by-step guides for Pixel features, gestures, and privacy controls.\n\nThe report indicates that this new feature appears to utilize the existing \"Device Assistance\" linked application, which was previously named \"Utilities.\" Currently, this functionality has only been observed on the Pixel 11 Pro model upgraded to Google app beta 17.52, and is not yet available on the standard Pixel 11 or older models.",
