    title: "Google 地圖流量數據故障問題重現，特別影響 Android Auto 用戶的導航體驗",
    summary: "Google Maps 的交通數據功能近期出現故障現象，尤其是在 Android Auto 系統上。該應用程式原本用於透過綠、黃、紅線指示車流速度（綠為正常、黃為減速、紅為壅塞或停滯），是規劃最佳行進路線的重要工具。根據用戶回報，自兩週前甚至最近幾天以來，Google Maps 在 Android Auto 的預設導航介面中顯示的交通數據部分或完全失效。雖然某些地圖設定仍能顯示數據，但整體導航體驗受到影響。此問題也對部分直接在手機上使用 Google Maps 的用戶發生。目前 Google 尚未公開承認這波故障，但受影響用戶反映，暫時解除安裝 Google Maps 更新似乎能緩解問題。建議用戶留意官方公告或嘗試清除應用程式快取以解決導航數據異常。",
    tags: ["Google Maps", "Android Auto", "交通數據", "導航系統", "Android 平台"],
    title_en: "Google Maps Traffic Data Glitch Reappears, Affecting Navigation Experience for Android Auto Users",
    summary_en: "The traffic data feature in Google Maps has recently experienced malfunctions, particularly within the Android Auto system. This application feature is crucial for planning optimal routes, as it uses green, yellow, and red lines to indicate traffic flow speed (green for normal, yellow for slowing down, red for congestion or standstill). According to user reports, since two weeks ago and continuing through recent days, the traffic data displayed within Google Maps' default navigation interface on Android Auto has been partially or completely unavailable. Although some map settings still display data, the overall navigation experience is affected. This issue has also impacted users who use Google Maps directly on their phones. Google has not yet publicly acknowledged this glitch, but affected users report that temporarily uninstalling the Google Maps update seems to alleviate the problem. Users are advised to monitor official announcements or attempt clearing the application cache to resolve abnormal navigation data.",
